  "发送真实移动增量，仅显示远端光标。触屏可反复滑动；实体鼠标可移出画面操作本地按钮，重新进入不会跳位。关闭此开关恢复绝对模式。": "Sends real movement deltas and shows only the remote cursor. Swipe repeatedly on touchscreens. Physical mice can leave the view and return without jumping. Disable to restore absolute mode.",
