  "手动同步本地全部 ID 连接与当前地址簿，请确认它们属于同一服务器。IP 直连、密码及服务器密钥不参与同步。删除及冲突会先列出，不会自动执行。": "Manually sync all local ID connections with this address book; ensure they use the same server. Direct IP entries, passwords and keys are excluded. Deletions and conflicts are previewed, not automatic.",
