  "API 用于账号和地址簿，不替代 ID/中继服务器。导入后沿用当前中继配置，请确保属于同一网络。不会自动上传本地连接；不导入远端密码或密码哈希。": "API manages accounts and address books, not ID/relay service. Imports retain current relay settings; ensure the same network. Local connections are not uploaded automatically. Remote passwords and hashes are not imported.",
