  "先通过系统控制中心连接无线投屏，再打开顶部投屏胶囊，按系统提示将 StarRustDesk 单独投屏。是否提供该入口取决于设备、系统版本和接收端。": "Connect wireless projection in Control Center, then use the projection capsule to project StarRustDesk separately. Availability depends on the device, OS and receiver.",
  "投屏后画面仍竖向时，可在“控”中点“横屏”；点“自动旋转”恢复默认策略。横向外接屏被识别后会自动采用横屏。这里只调整本地窗口，不更改远端 Windows 分辨率。": "If projection stays portrait, choose Landscape under Controls. Auto rotate restores the default. Detected landscape displays use landscape automatically. This changes the local window, not remote resolution.",
  "鼠标模式：先将远端指针移到起点，轻点一次，第二次按住并拖动，松手结束。框选文件时请从文件列表或桌面的空白处开始；从文件上开始通常是拖动文件。": "Mouse mode: move the cursor to the start, tap once, then hold the second tap and drag. Release to finish. To box-select files, start on empty space; starting on a file usually drags it.",
