  "连接后默认显示折叠的“键”按钮，点击展开；“键”和“控”及其拖动柄均可移动到屏幕任意位置。": "A collapsed Keys button appears after connecting. Tap to expand. Keys, Controls and their handles can be moved anywhere.",
  "横屏时“键”默认位于左上角，“控”默认位于右上角，两个面板都向下展开。长按任意功能按钮可调整排序。": "In landscape, Keys defaults to the top left and Controls to the top right. Both expand downward. Hold a button to reorder it.",
  "Ctrl、Alt、Shift、Win/Cmd：点一下选中，相当于按住；再点一下释放，不需要手指一直按着。可以同时选中多个。": "Tap Ctrl, Alt, Shift or Win/Cmd to hold it; tap again to release. Several modifiers can be selected together.",
  "例如 Ctrl+C：点亮 Ctrl，再输入 C，最后再次点击 Ctrl 取消选中。Mac 常用 Cmd+C。Ctrl/Shift 也可配合鼠标多选文件，用完记得释放。": "For Ctrl+C, select Ctrl, type C, then release Ctrl. Macs usually use Cmd+C. Ctrl/Shift also work with mouse selection; release them afterwards.",
  "Ctrl+Shift+Esc 等完整组合键按钮：点一次发送整组按键，不会自动弹出本地键盘。": "Full shortcuts such as Ctrl+Shift+Esc send all keys with one tap without opening the local keyboard.",
  "打开软键盘时保留画面当前比例，按可见区域上移，不会整体缩小。": "Opening the soft keyboard preserves the current view scale and shifts it into the visible area without shrinking the whole desktop.",
  "手机和平板连接后显示独立键盘悬浮按钮，不用展开“控”；可拖到顺手的位置。点一下打开本地键盘，再点一下收起。": "Phones and tablets show a separate floating keyboard button after connecting. No need to expand Controls; drag it to a convenient position. Tap to open the local keyboard, and tap again to hide it.",
  "键盘开启后可继续点击远端其他输入框，输入仍直接传给远端，不因点按画面而收起；点击收起按钮、系统返回或输入法收起即可结束。": "While the keyboard is open, you can click other remote fields and keep typing directly on the remote device. Tapping the desktop does not close it. Use the keyboard button, system Back or the input method's hide action to end input.",
  "全屏三指上滑仍可打开键盘。实体键盘和完整组合键不会自动唤起软键盘。远端输入框没有可靠的焦点通知，需要用户主动打开键盘。": "A three-finger swipe up in full screen still opens the keyboard. Physical keys and preset shortcuts do not open the soft keyboard automatically. Remote fields do not provide reliable focus notifications; open the keyboard explicitly.",
  "竖屏时“控”保持底部横向工具栏；横屏时默认移动到右上角并向下展开。点击收起后保留“控”按钮。": "Controls use a bottom horizontal bar in portrait and expand down from the top right in landscape. Collapsing keeps the Controls button.",
  "未开启虚拟鼠标时，画面放大后可使用“移动画面”模式；开启虚拟鼠标后，直接单指拖动画面空白区域即可平移，鼠标本体专门控制远端指针。": "Without the virtual mouse, use Pan view after zooming. With it enabled, drag elsewhere with one finger to pan; the mouse itself moves the remote pointer.",
  "全屏三指上滑用于打开本地键盘，不是滚动手势；滚动请使用双指平行滑动。": "Swipe up with three fingers in full screen to open the keyboard. Use two parallel fingers to scroll.",
